	quest.0DE876A75B5BEDAC.quest_desc: [
		"A shelf that lowers power. Handy for fine-tuning low enchants."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Stoneshelf and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
